  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Orange is a new-generation co-polyester monofilament engineered with an advanced polymer blend to improve dynamic performance. Formerly known as Super Smash Orange, it delivers explosive power, excellent control and a smooth, direct response suitable for aggressive players. The 1.23 mm version emphasizes acceleration and feel, while the 1.28 mm version provides greater stability and durability for powerful hitters.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Orange（原名 Super Smash Orange）是一款采用新一代先进共聚酯配方开发的聚酯单丝球线，旨在提升整体动态性能。它兼具爆发力、精准控制以及顺畅直接的击球反馈，适合积极进攻型球员。1.23 毫米版本更强调加速与手感；1.28 毫米版本则更偏向稳定性和耐久性，特别适合力量型击球球员。"
  },

